Symbols Nerd Font Mono, vendored so terminals show nerd-font icons on devices
without a nerd font, as Ghostty does with its own built-in copy. The page asks
for it only once an icon appears.

repository  https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts
release     v3.5.0, NerdFontsSymbolsOnly.tar.xz
            sha256 b7ef2283462b435f1fe91d729dc412d5dbe34269dd2c7f4e1d803e4105c8d883,
            the same as nixpkgs' nerd-fonts.symbols-only
font        SymbolsNerdFontMono-Regular.ttf
            sha256 2dc316f2505a0cbfbcf6060a1b4ba85b0a2974189e30c0037cdedc436a25a4ff,
            converted unchanged to WOFF2 with woff2_compress, not subset
licence     MIT for Nerd Fonts, in LICENSE; each icon set keeps its own licence,
            listed in README.md, which is the release's own

To take a new release: convert its Mono font the same way and replace these
files.
